====================== Linux -Commands =====================
Built in command to navigate the shell
Cd, LS,WC
 
. uname -r -         give detail of your machine Linux Version.
. cd / -             change directory to root
. PWD -              Present working directory
. LS-                List files
. cd /usr/bin -      to check all binaries (then ls- Get all linux commands) or (cd / = ls = cd bin)
. cd sbin(system bin) - Kernal level command management
. Man -               manual detail give to commands







 

